{
 "experiment": {
  "name": "cifar10-ssl-matched-byol-bn",
  "family": "vision_ssl",
  "method": "byol",
  "status": "BYOL with the BatchNorm its projector and predictor specify. Single-factor change against configs/ssl_matched/cifar10_byol.json, whose three runs collapsed; budget, augmentation, optimizer, schedule, backbone, batch size, epochs and dataset are identical. Tests prereg/BYOL_NORMALIZATION_PREREG_FROZEN_20260913."
 },
 "seed": 20260850,
 "output_root": "/projects/EEG-foundation-model/yinghao/FMCA-AV/experiment_runs",
